#: ui/app.slint:2040
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Updates hold up on a phone whose network stumbles: a request GitHub didn't "
"get is made again after a moment, and a look on its own that failed is made "
"again in a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2041
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Opens again: 0.4.2 and 0.4.3 closed as soon as they started. Updates come "
"from the project's releases on GitHub, or from your server if you choose it, "
"and are looked for every hour while a vault is open, so a fix reaches you "
"the same day."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2042
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Your server can now fetch each new version from the project's releases by "
"itself, so updates show up here without anyone publishing them by hand."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2043
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Autofill in other apps checks who signed the app, not only its name: a login "
"saved from an app is tied to its certificate. A vault key renewed on a "
"computer is taken here with the new Secret Key and your master password. "
"Signed with the app's own release key: uninstall an older copy once before "
"installing it."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2044
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Passwords shown evenly spaced, in a font of the app's own. The Secret Key "
"shown two groups to a line, in bigger boxes. A recovery part read from the "
"picture it was hidden in. A new version offered as soon as your server has "
"it. The languages with their flags."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2045
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Pages spring back at their ends. Codes: tap or drag left to copy, drag right "
"to edit, hold to reorder; the circle goes from green to red. Password health "
"rebuilt, with filters. Forgot the master password: the recovery parts of the "
"emergency kit, scanned or typed. The site's icon next to its address. Join a "
"server with its address, pin and invite, or scan its code. Updates looked "
"for on every server the vault syncs through."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2046
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Secret fields with a cursor: tap where to fix a typo. Pages stretch at their "
"ends. Folders inside folders, a folder picker and the folders under All. "
"Colours for item and vault icons. Codes show their seconds; drag a card to "
"edit it. SSH keys in every common form, a passphrase asked once. The vault "
"renamed here; sync changes confirmed with the master password. A smaller "
"app, hidden in the recent apps view."
msgstr ""

#: ui/app.slint:2047
msgctxt "PhoneWindow"
msgid ""
"Scan the QR code from the computer to set up or sync. Unlock with "
"fingerprint, face or the screen lock. Pages rebuilt to scroll and fit, "
"folders, password health, exports, a fuller generator, item icons and "
"previews of attached pictures and PDFs."
msgstr ""

